      "canonicalType": "KnowledgeStatement",
      "label": "属性断言：The transfer function h(s)/δ_e(s) = 30(s-6)/(s(s^2+4s+13)). The RHP zero at s=6 causes an initial drop in altitude (nonminimum-phase behavior). The final value is h(∞)=13.8 ft. Estimated rise time t_r=0.5 sec, overshoot M_p=0.14, settling time t_s=2.3 sec; actual values from Matlab are t_r≈0.43 sec, M_p≈0.14, t_s≈2.6 sec.",
